 "short_name": "Mbizana",
 "_doc": "Winnie Madikizela-Mandela LM (formerly Mbizana; the bank block still says 'Mbizana Local Municipality'). eMunsoft 'TAX INVOICE/STATEMENT OF ACCOUNT', variant with METER READINGS columns METER NO. / TYPE / OLD / NEW / READING DATE / READING TYPE / CONSUMPTION (no levied amount, no date range) and an ACCOUNT DETAILS ledger DATE / CODE / DESCRIPTION / UNITS @ TARIFF * VALUE. Electricity-only account. Ledger codes: 000203 basic, 300001 peak kWh, 300002 off-peak kWh, 000505 'ELECTRICITY' (third TOU register, mapped to standard), 008888 payments, 009008 VAT, 009006 interest; catch-up lines such as 'JUNE BILLING' carry the electricity codes with .000 units and land in other_r with the basic charge. total_ex_vat_r = every electricity-coded ledger line. Meter number / reading flag / reading date come only from meter rows that moved (retired meters print .000 and are skipped); start/end readings are left blank because three registers are printed. Fingerprint: own VAT number (all) + bank-block name or masthead (any). IDENTITY mb_balance_identity_r = TOTAL DUE - opening balance - payments - VAT - interest (valid because the account carries only electricity): 0.00 on 11/11 bills, 0 checks.",
 "fingerprint": {
  "all": [
   "4320156815"
  ],
  "any": [
   "Mbizana Local Municipality",
   "Winnie Madikizela"
  ],
  "reject_if_text": []
 },
